        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccf",
          "text": " is critical to collecting the money you need to put your life back together again. To do this, your Lakewood truck accident attorney must prove fault. Proving fault is often difficult without evidence of wrongdoing. Yet, collecting the evidence for a truck accident claim is nearly impossible to do on your own. Especially when you need to concentrate your efforts on recovering from your injuries.",
