          "text": "At Dormer Harpring, our Denver truck accident lawyers can help you collect the evidence you need to win your truck accident claim. We have the resources and skills necessary to tackle even the most complex truck accident case. What type of evidence do you need for your truck accident claim?",
          "marks": []
