          "_key": "sccn",
          "text": "The ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccp",
          "text": "Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration",
          "marks": [
            "lcco"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccq",
          "text": " enacted new trucking laws in 2017. These laws require all commercial trucks to have electronic logging devices (ELDs) to track driving time. This means paper logs are no longer accepted without exemptions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bccz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lcct",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-truck-accident-lawyer/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lccw",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-truck-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccs",
          "text": "ELDs log the number of hours a driver is behind the wheel. Federal law restricts the number of consecutive hours a truck driver can drive. Truck driver fatigue is a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccu",
          "text": "common cause of trucking accidents",
          "marks": [
            "lcct"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccv",
          "text": ". Collecting these records can help your attorney see how many hours the truck driver drove. It can also help your lawyer determine if the truck driver or trucking company ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccx",
          "text": "violated any federal rules or regulations",
          "marks": [
            "lccw"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sccy",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcd1",
