        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sce4",
          "text": "It is important to collect truck accident evidence quickly. In the weeks and months following the truck accident, valuable evidence can be lost or destroyed. To prevent the loss of evidence, your ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sce6",
          "text": "truck accident lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "lce5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sce7",
          "text": " will need to send a spoliation of evidence letter to the trucking company.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bced",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lcea",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/why-hire-personal-injury-attorney/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sce9",
          "text": "This letter requests that the trucking company preserves all information and evidence that is critical to your case. If they fail to preserve this evidence, they could face serious sanctions and penalties. This is ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sceb",
          "text": "why it is important to contact a Lakewood truck accident attorney",
          "marks": [
            "lcea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scec",
          "text": " immediately after your accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
